WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.600
♪ “Origami” by Scott Buckley ♪

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
[pages turn, one to each beat]

3
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.800
[the pages riffle]

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Palo Alto, 19 June 1878: Sallie Gardner at a gallop, a photograph every 27 inches.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Animal Locomotion, 1887: 781 plates of people and animals in motion.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Plate 700: a buffalo, galloping.

7
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.300
Plate 683: a Virginia deer.

8
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Plate 720: a cat.

9
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.800
[the music falls away]

10
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.800
Plate 759: a cockatoo in flight.

11
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.000
[a page tears from the binding]

12
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.800
All four hooves off the ground at once, as the 1878 photographs showed.

13
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:32.000
[the music returns]

14
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:37.400
Photographs: Eadweard Muybridge. Music: “Origami”, Scott Buckley, CC BY 4.0.
